{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226620","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226620","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1422662001:1":{"text":"So, this is the Lucent Tree... It's truly a sight to behold.","source_cn":"这就是守护薄暮丛林的流荧树吗……真是让人震撼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x136FA0C4DFDC57E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422662002:1":{"text":"Indeed, this is the Lucent Tree, the very heart of the Dark Forest, the sacred tree blessed by Misarte herself.","source_cn":"这就是流荧树，薄暮丛林的中心，弥萨忒祝福之树。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x731C8CBCEAEBE734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422662003:1":{"text":"Now, I shall commune with the Lucent Tree and await the guidance of Misarte.","source_cn":"接下来，我会与流荧树感应，聆听弥萨忒的指引。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x622C7E079F48A81F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422662004:1":{"text":"However, it takes some time to communicate with the Lucent Tree.","source_cn":"只是，与流荧树的沟通需要花些时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x333E52631276361E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422662005:1":{"text":"I don't mind waiting. My people waited a thousand years to learn of the curse. A little longer means nothing now.","source_cn":"我不介意等待，知晓诅咒之事都已花了千年，何况这一息时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22E19ABA675DD2A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422662006:1":{"text":"Rest easy, Indris. Eironn stands as the Scion of the Lucent Tree, chosen and blessed by the divine.","source_cn":"因度厄，放心吧。埃隆是流荧树之子，深受眷顾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x759194F6DEC80E45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422662007:1":{"text":"Don't mention my title. It's embarrassing.","source_cn":"……别提这个称号，太羞耻了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F49D284981A83E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1422662007":{"text":"Don't mention my title. It's embarrassing.","source_cn":"……别提这个称号，太羞耻了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F49D284981A83E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422662008:1":{"text":"See? Even <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> agrees with me.","source_cn":"看吧，连<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3F5CC2BA7049691C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"See? Even <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> agrees with me.","female":"See? Even <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> agrees with me.","variant_male_record_index":"165449","variant_female_record_index":"165450","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422662009:1":{"text":"You deserve the title. No one understands the Lucent Tree better than you.","source_cn":"流荧树之子名副其实，毕竟没人比你更能理解它的意志。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C2C069F7B8C26AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422662012:1":{"text":"Alright, allow me a moment to focus. Please wait here while I commune with the Lucent Tree.","source_cn":"……我还是专注正事吧。请大家在这里稍作等待，我去与流荧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBFD932CC8AFDE60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"It's a nice title to have.","source_cn":"我觉得这个称号很好","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC9C4A8705CD9A925","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's a nice title to have.","female":"It's a nice title to have.","variant_male_record_index":"72980","variant_female_record_index":"72981","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422662010:1":{"text":"Finally, someone understands. This title feels so overblown... like I'm meant to be some kind of mythic figure.","source_cn":"总算有人理解我的感受。这称号听起来太夸张了，好像我是什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74528724EDCF3B3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422662011:1":{"text":"Chippy thinks it's super cool! Scion of the Lucent Tree! Savior of the Dark Forest! Like a hero out of a legend!","source_cn":"满满觉得挺酷的！流荧树之子！听起来就超厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31C1A59210792F77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"Yeah, I'm embarrassed for you.","source_cn":"我也替你尴尬了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD96693DC23584E24","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yeah, I'm embarrassed for you.","female":"Yeah, I'm embarrassed for you.","variant_male_record_index":"72982","variant_female_record_index":"72983","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"Indris","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"Eironn","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"Bryon","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":4}}